{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581040/extras/4f89f07ceb2600f4357b73949b3c737b.poster.avif?t=1773433374\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581040/extras/4f89f07ceb2600f4357b73949b3c737b.webm?t=1773433374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581040/extras/4f89f07ceb2600f4357b73949b3c737b.mp4?t=1773433374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581040/extras/1736c115853e0e9b04109f2e3a579cb5.avif?t=1773433374\" width=903 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bharat Police is focused on progression and systemic reactions to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officers gain confidence, suffer injuries, or lose morale.<br>Send someone alone too often? They might grow stronger \u2014 or burn out.<br>Failures leave marks. Success builds resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is long-term people management, not just mission resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581040/extras/3b11e995c860fe8dc6429772f6d41d72.avif?t=1773433374\" width=903 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No long narrative cutscenes.<br>No scripted dramatic arcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just situation analysis, resource allocation, and calculated risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape the department:<br>careful, aggressive, exhausted, or disciplined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581040/extras/a36fff92a9694dd31864634a51823cd4.avif?t=1773433374\" width=903 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officers can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >become injured</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >suffer fatigue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gain self-confidence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lose morale after consecutive failures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience the impact of tragic events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your squad evolves over time \u2014 for better or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581040/extras/4299aae2c86cdd70c7e68165720b7535.avif?t=1773433374\" width=903 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social tension, public unrest, political pressure, and unique local incidents create a distinctive operational environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bharat Police is a systemic management experience with cultural context \u2014 not a story-driven drama.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581040?t=1773433374","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581040/0817c7af178ad1bc1e40851ed26781bcf4c69155/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773433374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581040/a0f0ac4e55095bc459fccb095e023a1601628570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773433374","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581040/a0f0ac4e55095bc459fccb095e023a1601628570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773433374","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4026650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=