_item_assets/steam/apps/3581040/extras/a36fff92a9694dd31864634a51823cd4.avif?t=1773433374\" width=903 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officers can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >become injured</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >suffer fatigue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gain self-confidence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lose morale after consecutive failures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience the impact of tragic events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your squad evolves over time \u2014 for better or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581040/extras/4299aae2c86cdd70c7e68165720b7535.avif?t=1773433374\" width=903 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social tension, public unrest, political pressure, and unique local incidents create a distinctive operational environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bharat Police is a systemic management experience with cultural context \u2014 not a story-driven drama.</p>","developers":["BharatPoliceGroup"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581040/429f6d5890bfd69163f14b910027d0d71ac19387/header.jpg?t=1773433374","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3581040/1548942376/b56631a19ef8f96ecc1240b5223b1e9b8e68ce85/1757871049/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757872258","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3581040/1548942376/b56631a19ef8f96ecc1240b5223b1e9b8e68ce85/1757871049/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757872258","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3581040/1548942376/b56631a19ef8f96ecc1240b5223b1e9b8e68ce85/